/v1/","context":{"app_id":4475750,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4475750-1846651706683272","game_id":"steam-4475750","kind":"announcement","title":"Improved physics/steering + Racetrack Tools now in Level Editor + More!","summary":"Big DEMO Update Improved physics/steering + Racetrack Tools now in Level Editor + More!We haven't had a lot of time to address feedback, but have still done some work on the driving model that we think will be appreciated by players.Keep in mind that the driving/physics are always a work in progress, as we will continue to improve them as time goes on. Your feedback has been very helpful - even if negative!Check out the DEMO changes below...DRIVING(physics improvements are ongoing)Changed steeri","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T22:21:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706683272","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4475750-1845383656383437","game_id":"steam-4475750","kind":"announcement","title":"GRIP 2 DEMO is OUT!","summary":"It's here: the GRIP 2 DEMO has landed 🤘We've been eager to get this new and improved game into your hands, and now we can finally do it.What are you waiting for... go download the DEMO! Still here? Ok, here's some info on what's changed since the GRIP XR demo (everything still WIP, obviously)New Racetrack: Haze 2.0 🏁 As well as 4 prototype tracks from the last demo, with some gameplay improvements 1 playground map that has admittedly been untouchedBetter, more stable vehicle physics - and we're ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T18:11:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656383437","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4475750-1844115010505366","game_id":"steam-4475750","kind":"announcement","title":"GRIP 2: Combat Racing Evolved","summary":"GRIP XR is now GRIP 2 🤘Check out that sweet logo and key art...And new teaser trailer:We've done it. We've changed the name. (we're waiting for Steam to change the actual title on the Steam page though)Why?Well, GRIP XR was confusing as hell to a lot of people considering \"XR\" is well known to mean Extended Reality, and people thought this was a new VR-only version of GRIP.But more importantly, we think this game will be worthy of sequel status now that we've been working on it more since the la","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-22T20:32:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010505366","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4475750-1840310314346013","game_id":"steam-4475750","kind":"announcement","title":"GRIP XR Demo being removed until October NextFest","summary":"Pilots!(still not 100% sure about that nickname honestly)The GRIP XR Kickstarter successfully funded last month, and we've been hard at work developing the game towards its next milestone: a Steam NextFest demo in OctoberConsidering the current demo is now out of date in terms of missing things we've improved or plan to change, we're taking it down on Monday (August 10th) as it's no longer a relevant representation of the game.As mentioned though, we'll be releasing a new and improved demo somet","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-07T19:26:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314346013","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4475750-1836506165563280","game_id":"steam-4475750","kind":"announcement","title":"48 HRS left! - New paint jobs & discounted bundle + GIVEAWAY","summary":"The GRIP XR Kickstarter is coming to an end just 48 hours from now!If you haven't checked it out, now's the time! --- CLICK HERE TO GO THE KICKSTARTER --- We've got some cool stretch goals laid out, with the next one being a custom tournament creator, which is within reach.Have a look:We also have a new backer tier bundle with both the custom graffiti and wanted poster at a discount, called \"Rep It Notoriously\". We figured some people might want both instead of having to chooseSexy Paint Jobs 👄🏎","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-30T17:43:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165563280","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4475750-1834602721202257","game_id":"steam-4475750","kind":"update","title":"GRIP XR Kickstarter is now live! + Demo Update","summary":"It's go time 🤘The GRIP XR Kickstarter has now launched!https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/cagedelement/grip-xr-a-futuristic-combat-racer?ref=9h35hrWe're calling on all GRIP fans - if you want more flippable flowstate driving, we could use your help!There's plenty of cool backing tiers to check out, like this one for the custom community-designed skin where you can submit your own image to be added to a paint job used across a bunch of vehiclesWe're really happy with how the Kickstarter page tu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-09T15:58:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721202257","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4475750-1832065502812223","game_id":"steam-4475750","kind":"announcement","title":"GRIP XR - DEMO Out Now!","summary":"(combat) Race day is finally here 🔥🏁We're happy to announce that a playable demo for GRIP XR is now availableTime to get back in the pilot's seat of the world's most heavy-duty, rocket-powered, flippable and weaponized race cars! Get ready to crank and turbo all over these new tracks, y'allWe've been eager to give GRIP fans another game to play, and it feels surreal to see an early version of it actually released into the wild. That said...This demo is an early work-in-progress, meaning a lot of","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-07T14:13:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832065502812223","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4475750":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:32:37Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T02:32:37Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4475750":"2026-10-26T02:32:37Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4475750":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:32:37Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:32:37Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4661040":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:32:37Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:32:37Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4475750","app_id":4475750,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:37Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"ef831137df6d3231d42d06c3db637a353a924e7fdc4b847b70952bd6b723187f","response_sha256":null,"source_field